module tasks.`2026-11-27-temp-and-install-staging-leaks`

task TempAndInstallStagingLeaks {
  title "Stop leaking disk: test temp folders in /tmp, old install copies, and formal evidence per workspace"
  verify $ make test-landing
  paths "Makefile", "scripts/**", "crates/bboxy450-harness/**", "crates/**/tests/**", "LAND.md"
  brief """
    # Disk leaks found on 2026-11-27 (free space fell to 9.4 GB)

    ROLE: EXECUTOR. Create a goal (Codex create_goal) from the outcome and hold it until the verify command exits 0 and the change is on origin/main.

    ## Evidence
    - /private/tmp held 97 folders named rich-app-XXXXXX (about 700 MB each) and rich-context-XXXXXX (about 230 MB each), dated 2026-11-20 to 2026-11-27, no process using them: a test or script creates them with mktemp and never removes them.
    - ~/Applications held 34 folders .bboxy450-term-install.XXXXXX and .bboxy450-harness-install.XXXXXX of about 130 MB each: Makefile install_bundle (Makefile:891) keeps previous-Contents of every install forever. A running app executes from the newest one, so that one must stay.
    - A finished task's workspace held four 6.1 GB copies of crates/bboxy450-harness/verification/evidence/<hash>, one per formal run, and could not be released (workspace_dirty) because of them.

    ## Outcome
    - Whatever creates rich-app-* and rich-context-* removes them on exit, pass or fail; find it by name in the harness and term trees.
    - install_bundle keeps the staging copy any live process still maps plus the newest one, and deletes the rest at the end of an install.
    - Harness formal evidence in a worktree keeps only the newest source hash, or goes to the shared Git evidence store that make prune-formal-evidence already manages (LAND.md "Formal evidence retention").
    - make test-landing covers each rule with a fixture.

    Land with make land. Report with reports/2026-11-27-temp-and-install-staging-leaks.den, naming what you removed.
    """

  managed {
    authorship = json"{\"kind\":\"seat\",\"process_generation\":\"1\",\"public_key\":\"XLMAqZTUlsEIvVxlAso8YDW5Ud3ShPEW3Kz+hD0wm1c=\",\"signer\":\"seat:01M89Z74HN4GSHEPS6TC0H6FDX\"}"
    created = json"\"2026-11-27T17:41:03.968Z\""
    created_by = json"\"seat:01M89Z74HN4GSHEPS6TC0H6FDX\""
    delegated_by = json"\"seat:01M89Z74HN4GSHEPS6TC0H6FDX\""
    id = json"\"01M8F1HAR7RJKPZBNM1ZKA86Z3\""
    number = json"1794292861628023"
    status = Open
    swarm = json"\"01M7P04CW1T6KY8CMSS6DQM12Q\""
